---
subject: Non sei piu teamleader di {{ sector_name }}
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Ruolo teamleader rimosso</title></head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; color: #333;">
  <h1>Ciao {{ recipient_name }},</h1>
  <p>{{ actor_name }} ha aggiornato il settore <strong>{{ sector_name }}</strong> e non risulti piu tra i teamleader.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ sector_url }}">Apri settore</a></p>
</body>
</html>